{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27335","headline":"病宫人 · 袁不约","name":"病宫人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佳人卧病动经秋，帘幕繿縿不挂钩。\n四体强扶藤夹膝，双环慵整玉搔头。\n花颜有幸君王问，药饵无徵待诏愁。\n惆怅近来销瘦尽，泪珠时傍枕函流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁不约","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27335.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27335","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}